Package: colortheme
Type: Package
Title: Unified Color Theme Management and Scales for R Graphics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ryoichi", "Asashiba", email = "ryoichi.asashiba@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-9532-7000"))
  )
Description: Provides a unified, lightweight interface for creating, modifying, 
    and managing qualitative, sequential, and diverging color themes in R. 
    Supports a compact URL-like query syntax for on-the-fly theme customization 
    (such as reversing palettes, switching theme types, or adjusting transparency), 
    lazy-loaded theme registries across multiple palette packages, direct value-to-color 
    mapping for base R graphics, and seamless scale integration for 'ggplot2'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
